  "result": "Quiz 0002 is written, with its key, for objective O4: `quizzes/0002.json` and `keys/0002.json`.\n\n- **Content:** It has six items and covers three ideas, two items each:\n  - **Who owns the control flow:** q1 (multiple choice) and q2 (short answer).\n  - **When a fixed workflow is the better choice:** q3 (multiple choice) and q5 (multiple choice).\n  - **When an agent is the better choice, and the common mix-up:** q4 and q6 (short answer).\n- **Format:** All the scenarios come from the makerspace assistant: booking, manual lookups and troubleshooting. Following your preferences, half are free response, and each multiple-choice item has five plausible options.\n- **Lessons:** This quiz is ahead of the lessons, since there is no O4 lesson yet. Its content follows Anthropic's \"Building effective agents\" distinction between workflows and agents. I wrote it from memory and did not search the web for it this time.\n- **Misconception ids:** I added three. M7 is \"using a model or tools makes a system an agent\", M8 is \"agents are always the better choice\" and M9 is \"a workflow has no model calls\". Existing ids were reused for M4 and M6.\n\nDo you want a lesson on O4 before you take the quiz?",
